2:T49e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I know if my Shopify store needs a redesign?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Key signals: conversion rate below industry average (typically 1.5–3%), mobile experience notably worse than desktop, bounce rate above 70% on key pages, outdated brand presentation, or Core Web Vitals scores below 50. We offer a free store audit to assess this."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will a redesign hurt my SEO rankings?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not if managed correctly. We audit your current rankings, preserve all existing URL structures and implement 301 redirects for any URLs that must change — protecting your rankings through the transition."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is a redesign different from a CRO optimization?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A redesign overhauls the visual system, information architecture and layouts — typically when the store's structure itself is the problem. CRO optimization makes targeted improvements to an existing design based on data. Both are valuable; the audit tells us which is right."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Shopify Store Redesign & Optimization\",\"description\":\"Shopify store redesign that improves conversion, brand presentation and SEO simultaneously. Data-led redesigns that fix what's costing you sales — not just what looks dated.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/store-redesign-optimization\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"svc-hero theme-dark","id":"top","children":[["$","div